    "created_at": "2024-11-09T17:14:47Z",
    "updated_at": "2024-11-09T17:14:47Z",
    "body": "> @annevk  This would have to be a new opt-in attribute of some kind. Currently the default is black and we cannot change that at this point.\r\n\r\nSupposing `input[type=color]` is extended to allow for ARGB (via some `<input />` attribute then _transparent black_ could be the new default, which works just-as-well.",
