    "created_at": "2024-11-10T07:34:00Z",
    "updated_at": "2024-11-10T07:34:00Z",
    "body": "I did add such attributes recently (one to allow for Display P3 and one to allow for an alpha channel), but I didn't end up changing this. I had forgotten about this issue, but it's also not clear to me this is needed. This is not something color pickers tend to support.",
