    "created_at": "2025-01-17T08:22:20Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-01-17T08:22:20Z",
    "body": "I couldn't use native input color because of empty value not allowed for 10 years,\nnow trying to swith to native, it is still a roadblock.  \n\nIf it is not allowed, I need to give a default color everytime I use it.\nFor example, default black color(#000000) is not valid when using it for background color of my table.\nPlus, sometimes I need to enable-disable some features according to empty value, no way.\n\nCurrently using [spectrum-js ](https://github.com/bgrins/spectrum)as color picker, its empty state:\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0ebe98e1-37a4-4e68-bff6-1183bb66240e)\n\nselected state:\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/62cc319a-1f4d-46dc-bb5a-fb0bbf0488d2)",
